      "id": "claim_7b3dee56ce994d138769a05bf42919bf",
      "statement": "KnowledgeRuntimeService.resolveCanonicalOkfBase() resolves the OKF base from the OKF_BASE env var when set, defaulting to the repo-root 'knowledge' directory (CANONICAL_OKF_PATH), and throws KNOWLEDGE_RUNTIME_PACKAGES_KNOWLEDGE_NOT_CANONICAL when the resolved candidate realpaths to the legacy packages/knowledge directory, and KNOWLEDGE_RUNTIME_OKF_BASE_MISSING when the candidate does not exist (unless allowMissing).",
